  "description": "The systemic devaluation of women, often manifesting as the belief that women are less competent, less intelligent, or less deserving of resources and opportunities than men. The meme uses the woman’s appearance and the juxtaposition with the man’s death to imply she is undeserving while he is more deserving, reinforcing gender-based bias.",
